CVM's ffmpeg.exe: licence notice
================================

This folder builds CVM's own ffmpeg.exe (build.sh, inside.sh, Dockerfile)
from unmodified upstream sources plus the patches in patches/. It contains
no FFmpeg source of its own beyond those patches. Nothing here changes the
licence of the rest of this repository, which is MIT (see LICENSE at the
