Distribution
------------

The binary is built on the machine that runs it (pnpm ffmpeg:install) and is
not published by this repository. Anyone who does pass the built ffmpeg.exe on
must do so under GPL-3.0-or-later, with this folder (the build scripts and
patches, which together with the upstream sources above are its complete
